{
  "map": "UndeadRE03Interlude",
  "title": "A Looming Shadow",
  "locale": "zhTW",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "貝恩德要求亡靈守衛護送他的伐木工。他顯然想砍伐銀松森林的木材。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 25,
        "speaker_string_id": 20,
        "dialogue_id": "A3I-C010-010-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "他又在抱怨提里斯法森林的「樹木品質」了嗎？",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 26,
        "speaker_string_id": 21,
        "dialogue_id": "A3I-C010-020-ANYA"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "他就是這樣。我試著告訴他銀松森林到處都是危險，最好待在幽暗城附近，會比較…",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 27,
        "speaker_string_id": 22,
        "dialogue_id": "A3I-C010-030-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "加瑞克",
      "text": "…安全。",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 28,
        "speaker_string_id": 23,
        "dialogue_id": "A3I-C010-040-GAREK"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "安雅",
      "text": "不…",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 29,
        "speaker_string_id": 24,
        "dialogue_id": "A3I-C010-050-ANYA"
      }
    }
  ]
}